#15700
Credits - Legend~
   This area, mirrored after the 80's movie Legend is for groups from 
levels 30-50. The first part of the area is moderately easy, increasing
in difficulty in the swamp, and further still in the tree. Unlike other
areas, this proceeds linearly..in that to get the next stage, a number of
keys and containers must be obtained and explored. If the whole of the area
is accomplished, the player must backtrack to find retrieve the area's
main item, the Universal Balance.
It has 2 spec procs: Una, which will give you a key upon receiving a kiss.
                    The Alicorn: which gives you the final key upon
                    receiving its horn.
This area was written by Morgana in March '98
-Kurse
~
157 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
D2
~
~
0 0 -1
D5
Legend
