#15702
A Small Cottage~
You have entered the dwelling of the forest’s poor folk.  At one point,
before the land fell to the icy grasp of evil, this was the richest of
all homes.  Rich in love and beauty and innocence.  Now, however, all
you see is a home suspended in time.  Faces Frozen with Fright.
~
