#15704
The Forest of Innocence~
Large Oak Trees, willow rings, sassafras and spearmint colored this
part of the forest before the Mother of Night began to mire its
existence.  Her grasp grows steadily as the sun sets.  Her intentions
are simple, to cast the Forest in eternal blackness. 
