#15712
The Edge of Innocence~
Your first step out of the Forest of Innocence fills you with remorse
as the impending doom closes in around you.  Those whose hearts are
already black, seem drawn to this place.  Those, pure of heart,
hesitate as an ominous presence looms over their very souls.
~
