#15722
Elderberry Patch~
At one time, this infamous patch produced the finest elderberries in
the land.  However, darkness has turned the serene patch into a growth
of wicked vines, alive with piercing thorns.  The berries, once used to
produce the Elderberry Wine, lie rotting on the ground.
~
