#15724
Field of Lily’s~
As a tribute to the King’s first daughter, majestic fields of lilies
were spread out over acres and acres of forest meadows.  Oddly enough,
this is the only place in the forest, which remains untouched by Lord
Darkness's evil. Maybe it is the spirit of the girl who fights for
her innocence and freedom, that keeps these flowers flourishing. 
~
