#15743
Base of the Tree~
You feel a frigid chill run up your spine as you draw closer to The
Great Tree.  In the distance, you hear torturous screams.  The wind
cuts through you like a knife, and the blackness sears your eyes.  
As a seasoned adventurer, you have learned to rely on your senses.  
Well your senses tell you to turn back now!  You have traveled down 
the wrong path.
~
